sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant API as API FastAPI
    participant MW as Middleware
    participant CACHE as Redis Cache
    participant M1 as Module 1<br/>Sentiment
    participant M2 as Module 2<br/>Recommendation
    participant QDRANT as Qdrant
    participant PG as PostgreSQL

    C->>API: POST /api/v1/recommendations
    API->>MW: Génère correlation_id
    MW-->>API: X-Correlation-ID: uuid

    API->>CACHE: Vérification cache (3 niveaux)

    alt Cache HIT
        CACHE-->>API: Résultat en cache (~2ms)
        API-->>C: 200 OK + recommendations
    else Cache MISS
        CACHE-->>API: null

        API->>M1: analyze(commentaire)
        Note over M1: distil-camembert<br/>Tokenisation → Inférence<br/>→ Softmax → Score [-1,+1]
        M1-->>API: SentimentResult (score, label, confidence) ~45ms

        API->>M2: recommend(product_id, sentiment_score)
        M2->>M2: encode(commentaire) → embedding 768d ~80ms
        M2->>QDRANT: search(vector, top_k=20) ~12ms
        QDRANT-->>M2: SimilarProducts (scores cosinus)

        M2->>PG: get_vehicles(product_ids)
        PG-->>M2: Vehicle details

        Note over M2: Scoring multicritères:<br/>0.6 × similarité<br/>+ 0.25 × disponibilité<br/>+ 0.15 × réputation

        M2-->>API: RecommendationResult (top_k classés)

        API->>CACHE: store(result, TTL=3600s)
        API-->>C: 200 OK + recommendations ~185ms
    end
